escription":"Hanako_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ふふっ。お待ちしておりましたよ、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/wf9nHtrsqVDNEozV5BOrkHTZGpwQ57fx.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"こんにちは、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/h8J9e7ti5m3u5bkSs2lE3mVd2ZYpxla5.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"来ていただいて、ありがとうございます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/MBRw89xGsfNryHPsktvQLfkCxmvSE8Rb.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"こうしていると涼しくて、とっても気持ち良いんですよ。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/jsqwJM63Dt8nQsrIm5Isg31KnCRae2sD.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"私にとっての特等席なんです、ふふっ……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/xqsXDNoBO2V0Y1jncfAdHw0cf9Yk37BY.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"せっかくですし、先生もいかがですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/tAe1gAnkkA80dcApvg779CP0uf8ZIqTc.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"ここで一緒に、脱いでしまいません……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/xFCnRBsdeDd8bXzlN4umuKc9wmN3M7ux.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"こうして、こんな真っ昼間から素肌をさらしていると、 何だか楽しくなってくるんですよ？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/Pe2WI5xDh5Jzk6lrXPqn7aEOVQLGocA0.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"イケないことをしてる……そんな感じがして。","text_original":"