らも私のこと、見捨てないでくださいね？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/SrITJzMGBElllsRpvofJswB2unlSE7nY.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"聖なる夜……ああ、すごく楽しみですね…… ……あ、ただの独り言です。お気になさらず。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/uEcT8LyuivT3Gxpg6IkCRXpX1l69B4k0.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_Tactic_Defeat_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"もう、あしこしが立ちません。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/FGdYNAoLEOyoUVul8roYq3CfkE3QCN1X.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_Tactic_Defeat_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"少し、余所見わ過ぎました","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/037kTcruT7HCTJxxjKZcjw2ornaRFP2Y.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_Tactic_In_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"さぁー始めましょうか","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/VKVzutCGpSIjjaG6QnIpNCyuJ2YmaR6D.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_Tactic_In_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"全部...先生の言う通りにしますよ、うふふ～","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/1vsNS0wrzs2DGXRhGxdsWgvz1E4l0VWk.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_Tactic_Victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"あは、こんな感じでいいでしょうか","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/06DTwCdvlE0uPEThSzYF3Cygat9BUJkH.ogg"},{"description":"Hanako_Tactic_Victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"さすが先生、すーごいです！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/Kz9oGEiBfTxD35HwX5OnxKjPG0TGos0D.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"hanako_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"不应该是这样的……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%20%E8%8A%B1%E5%AD%90/XgsDFmUQIG1UqqkfZ343nXk